def cap (n e h:ℕ)(C:ℝ):ℝ:=2^(e+h+2)*((e+1:ℕ):ℝ)*((h+e+1:ℕ):ℝ)*C^(2*n)
local notation "B₀" => binder side y
local notation "H₀" => (∑a,k a)
local notation "x₀" => WilsonReceivedChronologicalSocket.lit (V:=Fin n)

theorem original (filed:Filed (K:=K) (draw:=draw) (rate:=rate) (δ:=δ) cells κ pt seed side y t H)
    {x C:ℝ}{E:ℕ}(xp:1≤x)(cp:1≤C)(beta:1≤R.family.path.levels.clock.hatBeta (j+1))
    (clock:R.family.path.levels.clock.hatBeta (j+1)≤x^2)(allow:δ≤1)(rent:0≤rate)
    (out:rate≤C*x^E)(test:∀a,‖t a‖≤C*x^E):
    ∏z:I,(1+2^(e+mass k z.val.val+2)*∑a:Fin (e+1),(words H z).fare a) ≤ (1+cap n e (H₀) C)^(Fintype.card I)*
        x^((2+2*n*E)*Fintype.card I):=by
  let A:=C*x^E
  have large:1≤A:=one_le_mul_of_one_le_of_one_le cp (one_le_pow₀ xp)
  have pos:0≤A:=zero_le_one.trans large
  have size (z:I):z.val.val.card≤n:=by simpa using z.val.val.card_le_univ
  have rank (z:I):mass k z.val.val≤∑a,k a:=
    Finset.sum_le_sum_of_subset_of_nonneg (subset_univ _) fun _ _ _=>Nat.zero_le _
  have wage (z:I):(∏a∈z.val.val,‖t a‖)≤A^n:=by
    calc
      _ ≤ ∏_a∈z.val.val,A:=Finset.prod_le_prod (fun _ _=>norm_nonneg _) (fun a _=>test a)
      _ = A^z.val.val.card:=Finset.prod_const _ 
      _ ≤ A^n:=pow_le_pow_right₀ large (size z)
  have ticket (z:I):rate^z.val.val.card≤A^n:=
    (pow_le_pow_left₀ rent out _).trans (pow_le_pow_right₀ large (size z))
  have heat:R.family.path.levels.clock.hatBeta (j+1)^δ≤x^2:=
    (Real.rpow_le_rpow_of_exponent_le beta allow).trans ((Real.rpow_one _).le.trans clock)
  let c₀:ℝ:=(e+1:ℕ)*((∑a,k a)+e+1:ℕ)
  have ht(z:I):head (R:=R) (k:=k) (e:=e) (δ:=δ) (rate:=rate) (j:=j) t z≤c₀*(A^n*(x^2*A^n)):=by
    unfold WilsonOriginalTwoFlatIRFlatSalary.head
    dsimp only
    refine mul_le_mul ?_ (mul_le_mul (wage z) (mul_le_mul heat (ticket z) (pow_nonneg rent _) (sq_nonneg _)) ?_ (pow_nonneg pos _)) ?_ ?_
    · exact mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left (by exact_mod_cast Nat.add_le_add_right (Nat.add_le_add_right (rank z) _) _) (Nat.cast_nonneg _)
    · exact mul_nonneg (Real.rpow_nonneg (zero_le_one.trans beta) _) (pow_nonneg rent _)
    · exact mul_nonneg (prod_nonneg fun _ _=>norm_nonneg _) (mul_nonneg (Real.rpow_nonneg (zero_le_one.trans beta) _) (pow_nonneg rent _))
    · exact mul_nonneg (Nat.cast_nonneg _) (Nat.cast_nonneg _)
  have headBound (z:I):WilsonOriginalTwoFlatIRFlatSalary.head (R:=R) (k:=k) (e:=e) (δ:=δ) (rate:=rate) (j:=j) t z
      ≤c₀*C^(2*n)*x^(2+2*n*E):=by
    apply (ht z).trans_eq
    dsimp only [A]
    rw [mul_pow,←pow_mul]
    ring
  let g (z:I):ℝ:=2^(e+mass k z.val.val+2)*∑a:Fin (e+1),(words H z).fare a
  have fares (z:I):0≤∑a:Fin (e+1),(words H z).fare a:=Finset.sum_nonneg fun h _=>
    (tsum_nonneg ((words H z).paid h).price.1).trans ((words H z).paid h).price.2.2
  have paid (z:I):g z=2^(e+mass k z.val.val+2)*∑a:Fin (e+1),(words H z).fare a:=rfl
  have each (z:I):1+g z≤(1+cap n e (H₀) C)*x^(2+2*n*E):=by
    have rhs:=((WilsonOriginalTwoFlatIRFlatSalary.original κ pt cells seed y t H filed z).trans (headBound z))
    have powBound:(2:ℝ)^(e+mass k z.val.val+2)≤2^(e+(H₀)+2):=pow_le_pow_right₀ (by norm_num)
      (Nat.add_le_add_right (Nat.add_le_add_left (rank z) _) _)
    rw [paid]
    calc
      _≤1+((2:ℝ)^(e+(H₀)+2))*(c₀*C^(2*n)*x^(2+2*n*E)):=
        add_le_add_right (mul_le_mul powBound rhs (fares z) (by positivity)) _
      _≤x^(2+2*n*E)+((2:ℝ)^(e+(H₀)+2))*(c₀*C^(2*n)*x^(2+2*n*E)):=
        add_le_add_left (one_le_pow₀ xp) _
      _=(1+cap n e (H₀) C)*x^(2+2*n*E):=by dsimp only [cap,c₀];ring
  calc
    _ ≤ ∏z:I,((1+cap n e (H₀) C)*x^(2+2*n*E)):=by
      apply Finset.prod_le_prod _ (fun z _=>each z)
      intro z _
      change 0≤1+g z
      rw [paid]
      exact add_nonneg zero_le_one (mul_nonneg (by positivity) (fares z))
    _ = _:=by rw [Finset.prod_const,Finset.card_univ,mul_pow,pow_mul]

theorem discount {g a:ℝ}{p debt wanted:ℕ}(gp:0<g)(gc:g≤1)(an:0≤a)(kept:wanted+debt≤p+1):
    g^(p+1)*(a*(3*g⁻¹)^debt)≤(a*3^debt)*g^wanted:=by
  obtain ⟨k,h⟩:=Nat.exists_eq_add_of_le kept
  have ident:g^(p+1)*(a*(3*g⁻¹)^debt)=((a*3^debt)*g^wanted)*g^k:=by
    rw [h,pow_add,pow_add,mul_pow,inv_pow]
    field_simp
  rw [ident]
  exact mul_le_of_le_one_right (by positivity) (pow_le_one₀ gp.le gc)

